**Course Takeaways & Resources**:
- Stuckness is common and surmountable with awareness + systems.
- Curiosity, perseverance (strategic), subtraction, and action are high-leverage.
- Environment, names, social cues, and habits are hackable.
- Recommended Reading: Alter’s three books. Re-watch the podcast for inspiration.

This framework equips you with thorough, research-backed tools. Apply iteratively—small consistent moves yield breakthroughs. Success lies in motion, reflection, and adaptation. Start today with one friction audit.
